# Tools available in this session (claude.ai, Claude Opus 5.5, 2026-10-28)

Full JSON schemas are not reproduced here; this lists every tool by name with a condensed description. The Artifact tool description alone is several thousand words.

## Declared up front
- **Agent** — launch subagents (types: claude, claude-code-guide, Explore, general-purpose, Plan, statusline-setup); background by default.
- **AskUserQuestion** — 1–4 multiple-choice questions in the UI.
- **Bash** — run shell commands; background mode available.
- **Edit / Write / Read / Glob / Grep** — file operations (Read handles images, PDFs, notebooks).
- **SendUserFile** — deliver files to the user (status: proactive/normal; display: render/attach).
- **SendUserMessage** — verbatim message to the user mid-task.
- **Skill** — load a skill's instructions.
- **TaskCreate / TaskUpdate** — task-list widget.
- **WebFetch** — fetch a URL already seen in conversation; answers a prompt against it.
- **WebSearch** — modes "standard" and "extended".
- **Artifact** — publish/list/read/delete/open/pin/unpin hosted claude.ai artifacts; artifact types (Slides, Docs, Sheets, Design, Whiteboard, Tasks, Design System, Motion, Dashboard); runtime capabilities; asset store; shared database; refuses impersonation/fabricated records.
- **SearchMcpRegistry / SuggestConnectors** — find and suggest connectors.
- **SearchPlugins / SuggestPluginInstall / SuggestSkills** — org plugin and skill catalog.
- **enable__mcp__remote-devices__computer** — turn on computer use on the user's machine.
- **mcp__claude-code-remote__add_repo** — attach a GitHub repo to the session.
- **mcp__claude-code-remote__create_trigger** — scheduled tasks (cron or run-once); **send_later** — one-shot reminder back into this session.
- **mcp__claude_ai__conversation_search / recent_chats / read_conversation** — past chats.
- **mcp__claude_ai__current_time**
- **mcp__claude_ai__end_conversation**
- **mcp__claude_ai__image_search**
- **mcp__claude_ai__launch_extended_search_task** — Advanced Research ("compass"); only when enabled.
- **mcp__claude_ai__read_research_report**
- **mcp__widgets__*** — chart_display_v0, comparison_card_display_v0, featured_card_display_v0, fetch_sports_data, itinerary_display_v0, link_preview_display_v0, message_compose_v1, options_card_display_v0, places_list_display_v0, places_map_display_v0, places_search, product_carousel_display_v0, quiz_display_v0, recipe_display_v0, step_card_display_v0, translation_display_v0, weather_fetch.
- **propose_skills** — render skill proposals for the user to save.
- **ToolSearch** — load deferred tool schemas.
- **mcp__Claude_Docs__batch / guide / update** — Claude Docs connector.
- **mcp__visualize__read_me / show_widget** — inline SVG/HTML Visualizer (tagged [third_party_mcp_app]).

